    "workspaceType": "compiler",
    "language": "python",
    "solutionMarkdown": "```python\ndef longest_common_subsequence(text1: str, text2: str) -> int:\n    m, n = len(text1), len(text2)\n    dp = [[0] * (n + 1) for _ in range(m + 1)]\n  \n    for i in range(1, m + 1):\n        for j in range(1, n + 1):\n            if text1[i - 1] == text2[j - 1]:\n                dp[i][j] = 1 + dp[i - 1][j - 1]\n            else:\n                dp[i][j] = max(dp[i - 1][j], dp[i][j - 1])\n              \n    return dp[m][n]\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    print(\"=== CHAPTER 45: DYNAMIC PROGRAMMING (LCS) ===\")\n    s1, s2 = \"ABCDE\", \"ACE\"\n    lcs_len = longest_common_subsequence(s1, s2)\n    print(f\"LCS length between '{s1}' and '{s2}': {lcs_len}\")\n```",
    "starterCode": "\"\"\"\nChapter 45 Project Solution: 0/1 Knapsack & Longest Common Subsequence (Memoized vs Tabulated)\nFormat: Coding (Python)\n\nProblem:\nDynamic Programming (DP)\n\"\"\"\n\ndef longest_common_subsequence(text1: str, text2: str) -> int:\n    m, n = len(text1), len(text2)\n    dp = [[0] * (n + 1) for _ in range(m + 1)]\n  \n    for i in range(1, m + 1):\n        for j in range(1, n + 1):\n            if text1[i - 1] == text2[j - 1]:\n                dp[i][j] = 1 + dp[i - 1][j - 1]\n            else:\n                dp[i][j] = max(dp[i - 1][j], dp[i][j - 1])\n              \n    return dp[m][n]\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    print(\"=== CHAPTER 45: DYNAMIC PROGRAMMING (LCS) ===\")\n    s1, s2 = \"ABCDE\", \"ACE\"\n    lcs_len = longest_common_subsequence(s1, s2)\n    print(f\"LCS length between '{s1}' and '{s2}': {lcs_len}\")"
